{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>11 月 26 日是大埔宏福苑大火一周年，《集誌社》兵分多路採訪不同的悼念活動。阿妙整合<a href=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/%e5%ae%8f%e7%a6%8f%e8%8b%91%e7%81%ab%e7%81%bd%e4%b8%80%e5%b9%b4%ef%bd%9c%e8%81%96%e6%af%8d%e8%81%96%e8%a1%a3%e5%a0%82%e5%ae%89%e6%81%af%e5%bd%8c%e6%92%92%e3%80%80%e6%82%bc%e5%ae%8f%e7%a6%8f%e8%8b%91/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">悼念彌撒的現場情況</a>，死難者家屬的深情分享，以及聖堂神父如何看被警方的多次關心；又跟進市民自發<a href=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/%e5%ae%8f%e7%a6%8f%e8%8b%91%e5%a4%a7%e7%81%ab%e4%b8%80%e5%b9%b4%ef%bd%9c%e5%b8%82%e6%b0%91%e7%8d%bb%e8%8a%b1%e6%82%bc%e5%bf%b5/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">重返宏福苑附近獻花</a>、悼念現場的情況，以及死難者家屬和市民，為何不滿警方及<a href=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/%e5%ae%8f%e7%a6%8f%e8%8b%91%e5%a4%a7%e7%81%ab%e4%b8%80%e5%b9%b4%ef%bd%9c%e6%b0%91%e5%ae%89%e9%9a%8a%e3%80%8c%e6%94%b6%e8%8a%b1%e3%80%8d%e3%80%80%e6%82%bc%e5%bf%b5%e8%80%85%e3%80%8c%e8%ad%b7%e8%8a%b1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">民安隊當日處理獻花的手法</a>。<br/><br/>政府在宏福苑大火周年前夕，突然宣布對<a href=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/%e5%ae%8f%e7%a6%8f%e8%8b%91%e5%a4%a7%e7%81%ab%e4%b8%80%e5%b9%b4-%e5%90%91%e6%af%8f%e6%88%b6%e6%a5%ad%e4%b8%bb%e7%99%bc30%e8%90%ac%e6%96%b0%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb%e8%a3%9c%e5%8a%a9-%e7%bd%b9%e9%9b%a3/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">災民發放新的補助金</a>，同時預計，去年各界捐助災民的援助基金，所餘已「七七八八」，阿妙訪問宏福苑災民，對政府動用基金的手法有何意見。<br/><br/>此外，港澳辦和中聯辦在大火一周年前夕發稿，肯定特區政府的善後工作；外交公署則向駐港外媒溫馨提示，要正面報道宏福苑事件，阿妙訪問資助傳媒人楊健興，解構背後的因由。</p>\n<figure><p>\n</p></figure>\n<figure><p>\n</p></figure>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"237\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Payme-500x237.png\" width=\"500\"/></figure>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T06:34:40.425506+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":311,"images":1,"source":"The Collective HK","fallback":"rss-http-error","origin":"wordpress-public-posts","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T16:48:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T09:50:11.946862+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T06:28:03.784342+00:00","content_hash":"40312cedb7e7526db7b6d0a307049e0d465b2582f7ee34ab6573b94f2a8e8cea","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 520","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}